  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 98569064345522486
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: It is done.
    - rid: 794585351795024479
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Grandma left me a house. I thought my job was to restore it.
    - rid: 1341209833098369024
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: It is too long.
    - rid: 1624010169242138303
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And extremely photogenic.
    - rid: 2603236179278820723
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The Garden Cup is officially open.
    - rid: 3279309506124032602
      type: {class: ThoughtStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: One cup brought us home. The next one can begin a new story.
    - rid: 3378386808918064506
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: People with coffee.
    - rid: 4232608441697667376
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Then we will discuss it over another cup.
    - rid: 4750644843132358255
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Then I believe an announcement is in order.
    - rid: 4815553974655003340
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: People.
    - rid: 6017094723360328681
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The work is solid.
    - rid: 6506342576227592496
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 79f9981bdaa752d4fb771968622c6775, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That is a much better slogan.
    - rid: 7459902758165588999
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Now I think we restored what the house was for.
    - rid: 7632278637157118974
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And now?
    - rid: 7740095423295263021
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The house is standing proud again.
    - rid: 8565043952056864386
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Coffee?
    - rid: 9013388795491121069
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: The garden feels alive.
